<title>POLAND: LUBAWA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>LUBAWA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.11 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.13 vs   0.16</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.06 vs   0.18 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    1.59 vs   1.96</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.86 vs   0.87</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.07 vs   1.54</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.83 vs   2.03</p>
<p> Sales		   25.47 vs  20.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish technical garment maker is</p>
<p>Lubawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
